    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>和薅羊毛专家院长（微博@算了还是改回院长吧）、五大行理财经理Ivy、房地产投资自雇员Aaron聊一聊在加拿大如何从理财小白走向财富自由。</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐先听：</span><a href="https://anchor.fm/10lb/episodes/ep-e127ub9" data-url="https://anchor.fm/10lb/episodes/ep-e127ub9"><span>北美搞钱指南（上）</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>省钱技巧</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="21">00:21</a> 和家人开</span><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/financial-consumer-agency/services/banking/bank-accounts/joint-bank-account.html" data-url="https://www.canada.ca/en/financial-consumer-agency/services/banking/bank-accounts/joint-bank-account.html"><span>联名账户</span></a><span>的好处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="176">02:56</a> </span><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/financial-consumer-agency/services/mortgages/home-equity-line-credit.html" data-url="https://www.canada.ca/en/financial-consumer-agency/services/mortgages/home-equity-line-credit.html"><span>HELOC（房屋净值信用额度）</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a> 开</span><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/tax/businesses/small-businesses-self-employed-income/setting-your-business.html" data-url="https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/tax/businesses/small-businesses-self-employed-income/setting-your-business.html"><span>自雇公司</span></a><span>的好处</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>理财的风险和误区</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="731">12:11</a> 会计师是社会人的好朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="846">14:06</a> 区分好债务和坏债务</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1001">16:41</a> </span><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/financial-consumer-agency/services/credit-reports-score.html" data-url="https://www.canada.ca/en/financial-consumer-agency/services/credit-reports-score.html"><span>信用分</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1758">29:18</a> 共同基金会被拦腰斩吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2034">33:54</a> 网上银行会倒闭吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2229">37:09</a> 报税有必要找会计师吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2363">39:23</a> 投资需要慢慢耕耘</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>财富自由之路</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2639">43:59</a> 如果不信任中介，就考证成为中介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2707">45:07</a> 韭菜的自我修养是靠时间赚钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a> 升职加薪是打工人稳稳的幸福</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3062">51:02</a> 房产投资</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>花絮 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3182">53:02</a>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>往期推荐：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://xn--9hqzevnmte3b38io2az24a4sah1m3rlb5fq3ng4jj72p/" data-url="https://xn--9hqzevnmte3b38io2az24a4sah1m3rlb5fq3ng4jj72p/"><span>Ep. 如果你也想从零开始做播客丨单口</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="//Tinder囧遇：软件交友的尴尬经历（上）丨小象"><span>Ep. Tinder囧遇：软件交友的尴尬经历</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>如果喜欢我的节目，欢迎在</span><a href="https://afdian.net/@tenlb" data-url="https://afdian.net/@tenlb"><span>爱发电</span></a><span>（微信/支付宝）或</span><a href="https://www.patreon.com/tenlb" data-url="https://www.patreon.com/tenlb"><span>Patreon</span></a><span>（PayPal/Visa/Master Card）给我打赏，或者在苹果播客上给我五星好评；欢迎关注、私信播客的Instagram账号</span><a href="https://www.instagram.com/tenlb_pods" data-url="https://www.instagram.com/tenlb_pods"><span>@tenlb_pods</span></a><span>感谢你的支持。</span></p><span></span><p><span>可以在（非国区）苹果播客、Spotify、Google Podcast等平台订阅我的节目；推荐使用泛用型播客客户端通过RSS链接订阅我的播客，以保证听到完整的期数。RSS链接：</span><a href="https://anchor.fm/s/40837440/podcast/rss" data-url="https://anchor.fm/s/40837440/podcast/rss"><span>anchor.fm</span></a></p>]]></description>
