    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾是一名对整容知识很感兴趣的学生，她分享了自己两次整容手术的经历以及她在整容方面的知识和见解。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="52">00:52</a> 经历：全肋隆鼻和颧骨内推</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> 心态：明确目标才能收获自信而不上瘾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="993">16:33</a> 误区：营销号推广的“成功案例”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1362">22:42</a> 整圈审美是趋同的吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1606">26:46</a> 整容是收获外貌红利的捷径吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2347">39:07</a> 为什么“整容脸”会受歧视</span></p><span></span><p><span>猜你还想听：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://anchor.fm/10lb/episodes/ep-eqe6ai" data-url="https://anchor.fm/10lb/episodes/ep-eqe6ai"><span>Ep. 当我们谈论变美的时候我们在谈论什么丨百慕大肥鹅</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://anchor.fm/10lb/episodes/ep-etk7dp" data-url="https://anchor.fm/10lb/episodes/ep-etk7dp"><span>Ep. 喜欢就要表达出来丨王彩玲</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>如果喜欢我的节目，欢迎在</span><a href="https://afdian.net/@tenlb" data-url="https://afdian.net/@tenlb"><span>爱发电</span></a><span>（微信/支付宝）或</span><a href="https://www.patreon.com/tenlb" data-url="https://www.patreon.com/tenlb"><span>Patreon</span></a><span>（PayPal/Visa/Master Card）给我打赏，或者在苹果播客上给我五星好评；欢迎关注、私信播客的Instagram账号</span><a href="https://www.instagram.com/tenlb_pods" data-url="https://www.instagram.com/tenlb_pods"><span>@tenlb_pods</span></a><span>感谢你的支持。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我的另一档新播客是</span><a href="https://anchor.fm/notmine" data-url="https://anchor.fm/notmine"><span>《闻言文 Not Mine》</span></a><span>，是一档我阅读网友写的我很喜欢的文字的播客，每期长度大概是几分钟，希望可以为成年人提供一些睡前故事。可以在（非国区）苹果播客、Spotify、Google Podcast等平台订阅我的节目；推荐使用泛用型播客客户端通过RSS链接订阅我的播客，以保证听到完整的期数。 两档播客的RSS链接分别是：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《自以为是Inside out》：</span><a href="https://anchor.fm/s/40837440/podcast/rss" data-url="https://anchor.fm/s/40837440/podcast/rss"><span>